{"t":"RDW","made":"2026-11-25 03:52","name":"Redwire Corporation","ko":"레드와이어","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":1400,"hq":"Jacksonville, FL, United States","website":"https://www.rdw.com","summary_en":"Redwire Corporation provides critical space solutions and space infrastructure for government and commercial customers in the United States, Europe, and internationally. It operates in two segments Space and Defense Tech. The company offers sensors and avionics systems, including star trackers and sun sensors, which are critical for accurate navigation and control of spacecraft; camera systems; infrared, space situational awareness, and position timing and navigation payloads; It also provides software suite that enables digital engineering and generation of high-fidelity, interactive modeling and simulations of individual components, entire spacecraft, and full constellations in a cloud-based environment. In addition, the company offers microgravity payloads, radio frequency systems, antennas, spacecraft platforms and missions, and in-space manufacturing and biotech facilities, as well as field-proven uncrewed airborne system (UAS) technology. Further, it provides combat-proven autonomous systems, optical sensors, advanced optics, resilient energy solutions, and radio frequency payloads, as well as provides intelligence, surveillance, and reconnaissance capabilities for customers including the U.S. Department of War, U.S. Federal Civilian Agencies and allied governments across multiple domains. Redwire Corporation was founded in 2010 and is headquartered in Jacksonville, Florida.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Redwire Corporation은 미국, 유럽 및 전 세계의 정부 및 상업 고객에게 중요한 우주 솔루션과 우주 인프라를 제공합니다. Space와 Defense Tech의 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 우주선의 정확한 항법 및 제어에 중요한 별 추적기 및 태양 센서를 포함한 센서 및 항공 전자 시스템을 제공합니다. 카메라 시스템; 적외선, 우주 상황 인식, 위치 타이밍 및 내비게이션 페이로드; 또한 클라우드 기반 환경에서 개별 구성 요소, 전체 우주선 및 전체 별자리에 대한 디지털 엔지니어링과 충실도가 높은 대화형 모델링 및 시뮬레이션을 생성할 수 있는 소프트웨어 제품군을 제공합니다. 또한 이 회사는 미세 중력 탑재체, 무선 주파수 시스템, 안테나, 우주선 플랫폼 및 임무, 우주 내 제조 및 생명 공학 시설은 물론 현장에서 입증된 무인 항공기 시스템(UAS) 기술도 제공합니다. 또한 전투에서 입증된 자율 시스템, 광학 센서, 고급 광학, 복원력 있는 에너지 솔루션 및 무선 주파수 페이로드를 제공할 뿐만 아니라 미국 전쟁부, 미국 연방 민간 기관 및 여러 영역에 걸쳐 동맹 정부를 포함한 고객에게 정보, 감시 및 정찰 기능을 제공합니다. Redwire Corporation은 2010년에 설립되었으며 플로리다주 잭슨빌에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":6.06,"mcap":1516328960.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-21.956522,"peg":null,"ps":3.5110366,"pb":0.9379353,"ev_ebitda":-10.216,"div":0.0,"beta":3.126,"hi52":26.64,"lo52":5.12},"fin":{"rev":431875008.0,"rev_g":0.054,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.24098,"op":-0.3795,"net":-0.52359,"roe":-0.17117001,"fcf":-67604248.0,"cash":488120992.0,"debt":89921000.0,"de":5.588,"eps":-1.2,"feps":-0.276},"own":{"short":0.22799999,"inst":0.7447,"insider":0.01334},"analyst":{"n":10,"mean":11.6,"median":13.0,"high":15.0,"low":5.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.30769,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":6,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":6,"hold":4,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":6,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":0,"buy":6,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Canaccord Genuity","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":13.0,"priorPriceTarget":15.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"B. Riley Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":14.0,"priorPriceTarget":15.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-06","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":8.0,"priorPriceTarget":11.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Piper Sandler","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":11.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-09-15","Firm":"Guggenheim","T